nt.test.mjs: a project payload with meta.machine/machineVersion/remote/versionDrift; assert the title machine tag.\n- tests/command-center-hive.test.mjs and command-center-hive-panels.test.mjs: update the machines view expectations to the object/version shape.\n\nCONSTRAINTS: no peer fetching in the Command Center; use only the board payload. No new dependencies; no hard-coded sample data in production paths; keep the payload money-free. Target look stays; the machine tags are small muted mono, not a new headline.\n\nVerify: node --import ./tests/_isolate-config.mjs --test tests/command-center-counts.test.mjs tests/command-center-snapshot.test.mjs tests/command-center-hive.test.mjs tests/command-center-hive-panels.test.mjs tests/cc-hive-mount.test.mjs tests/cc-cockpit-mount.test.mjs tests/board-peers.test.mjs -> all pass.",
